agent
-------
when  your build or deployment runs.  the syetm begin one or more job present the agent is computing the infrastructure with installed agent softwre that runs one job at a time
 for ex: my job is run the 'ubunetu agent' which microsoft host
 
  types of agent :
   1. microsoft host agent : which host by microsoft and manged by them
   2. self host agentt : selft host and manged on your vms
   2. Azure vm scale set agent : same to self host agent but we can sacle the set or auto scale based on the deemend
   
 
under the task where add the agents :
 there is a option called 'manage' where i can the enable and disable the agnet
 
 
